# Exclure tous les fichiers lourds
public/uploads/**/*.mp4
public/uploads/**/*.webm
public/**/*.psd
public/**/*.PSD
public/comcon
public/iqos
public/gac
public/pertamina
public/photobooth-ia/style
public/tautaufest/style
public/haircut/style
public/pln/style
